png", "id": "907606738720889", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_907606745387555_7731673485454276941_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kvOWFyyVpGwQ7kNvwFFwEfg&_nc_oc=AdqiJvjOL7PA5QkHza1maz2uDvjBEbTJt0EDh_1G05U-UKfDWNwZzl6eNt9qjG2eYSc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEoPeMJUaJFSYgwkKDf3VDykAAykWwghMWFAGXxmDG4lg&oe=6A80542A"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 1.png", "id": "937129968774325", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823949_937129972107658_2389765946151677999_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R-b-8Z8txJAQ7kNvwFPPwhd&_nc_oc=AdrrU6LwfkXrFL7az1DUXidEfyg6wwtLoeaUp2yj6B5ztyNLz88f3lKCCiF_VWd-DuY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHUHhB7-odVcmCQvLgRZUTEY2g0T9kZ0MtD4VMuePXuow&oe=6A8040D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hero Cover - Landscape.png", "id": "1352264430284363", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293844_1352264436951029_649680003557304987_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BDb4s-veOUQQ7kNvwF6DEEq&_nc_oc=AdpT540yQvxXyVm8eCFjoB71TXQfE1wQNrSQy5ajuJLR4uxwPyYmHmlZn1ralrAUYDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG0KSKhOHvpmO_dTG8dJxEKOL_yEkzoKIrEVHJ2exHEEQ&oe=6A806E3D"}, "display_name": "Flip Hoops", "keywords": ["basketball", "arcade", "mixedreality", "physics", "spatial"], "long_description": "**Gravity just changed. Can you still hit the shot?**\n\nExperience gravity-defying **Mixed Reality basketball**\u2014or should we say **Teksab**? **Flip Hoops** transforms your actual room into a high-speed, **gravity-shifting arcade**. This isn\u2019t just about shooting hoops; it\u2019s a **spatial challenge** where you must survive a 33-second blitz as the \"ground\" flips in an instant.\n\n**\ud83c\udf00 THE ULTIMATE GRAVITY TWIST**In Flip Hoops, your environment is dynamic. One moment you\u2019re aiming for a standard rim on your wall; the next, the world rotates. Suddenly, your floor is the ceiling, and you have to launch the ball _downward_ into a basket hovering over your head. Designed for **high-fidelity passthrough**, your room is no longer just a room\u2014it's a 360-degree court where \"up\" and \"down\" are only suggestions.\n\n**\u2728 KEY FEATURES:**\n\n*   **\ud83c\udfc0 33 Seconds to Glory:** Every round is a high-intensity sprint. Can you master the \"Nothing but Net\" bonus and beat your personal best before the buzzer?\n    \n*   **\ud83d\udd90\ufe0f Pro Hand Tracking:** Leave the controllers behind. Reach out, grab, and flick your wrist to score with natural, **physics-based** movement.\n    \n*   **\ud83c\udfe0 True Mixed Reality:** Your walls and furniture become active backboards. Experience immersive **Quest 3, 3S, & Pro** mechanics.\n    \n*   **\ud83c\udfc3 Fitness & Movement:** Get moving! As featured on **SideQuest**, Flip Hoops keeps you reacting in a full-room workout.\n    \n**Your room is the court. The world is upside down. Are you ready to flip the game?**", "short_description": "Experience gravity-defying Mixed Reality basketball\u2014or should we say Teksab? Flip Hoops transforms your room into a shifting Quest arcade. Master the physics of a 33-second blitz as gravity rotates from floor to ceiling.\n\nCan you sink the shot when the world is upside down? Use Hand Tracking to grab and flick the ball, aiming for your walls and ceiling in a race against the clock. Perfect your form, beat your personal best, and master the art of the spatial swish."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fliphoops-privacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Digital Love", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/digital-love-landing-page", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category":